			"declarations": [
				{
					"kind": "class",
					"description": "Calculator panel, rendered into its light DOM. The toolkit coordinator in the runtime context supplies the calculator provider registered under the base of `tool-id`; the panel mounts a `calculator-type` calculator from it, limited to `available-types`, with `calculatorConfig` as the provider's options. The host shows it with `visible`; the panel shows a loading or error message until the calculator mounts, then the provider's attribution link when it declares one.",
